{
  "date": "2026-11-16",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "银联和蚂蚁一起做的“融合终端”上线，一台机器能收多种付款",
  "title_en": "The \"integrated terminal\" made by UnionPay and Ant goes live: one machine accepts many kinds of payment",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "中国银联和蚂蚁集团一起开发了一种新的收款机器，名字叫“全功能融合终端”。11月12日，这种终端在西安一家商场举行了首发仪式。银联商务负责卖这种终端，也负责它的运营，其他机构可以向银联商务购买。",
      "en": "China UnionPay and Ant Group have jointly developed a new payment-collecting machine called the \"full-function integrated terminal\". On November 12, a launch ceremony for the terminal was held at a shopping mall in Xi'an. UnionPay Merchant Services is responsible for selling the terminal and for running it, and other institutions can buy it from UnionPay Merchant Services."
    },
    {
      "zh": "商户用这一台机器，就可以收很多种付款：国内和外国的银行卡、二维码、手机Pay、支付宝的“碰一下”，还有数字人民币。数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的法定数字货币。",
      "en": "With this one machine, a merchant can accept many kinds of payment: domestic and foreign bank cards, QR codes, phone Pay services, Alipay's \"tap\" (碰一下), and the digital yuan. The digital yuan is the legal digital currency issued by the People's Bank of China."
    },
    {
      "zh": "除了付款，这种终端还能帮商户开电子发票，处理国家“以旧换新”补贴。如果一个商场里有很多商家一起经营，它还能自动把钱分给不同的商家。另外，外国游客在离开中国前买东西，也可以通过它办理退税。",
      "en": "Besides payments, the terminal can also help merchants issue electronic invoices and handle the national \"trade-in\" subsidies. If many sellers operate together in one mall, it can also automatically split the money among the different sellers. In addition, foreign tourists who buy things before leaving China can also get tax refunds through it."
    },
    {
      "zh": "据移动支付网介绍，高配版本的终端处理器速度在1.6GHz以上，存储空间至少有4GB+32GB；而普通的智能POS机一般是1.4GHz和2GB+16GB。",
      "en": "According to Mpaypass, the high-end version of the terminal has a processor speed of 1.6GHz or more and at least 4GB+32GB of storage, while ordinary smart POS machines usually have 1.4GHz and 2GB+16GB."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
    "url": "https://www.mpaypass.com.cn/news/202611/16083854.html"
  },
